{"product_id":"imperial-dragon-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-cues-master","title":"Dragon – X001","description":"\u003cp class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eCrafted from \u003cstrong\u003epremium ashwood\u003c\/strong\u003e, this exceptional cue features an intricately handcrafted \u003cstrong\u003edragon motif\u003c\/strong\u003e brought to life with shimmering \u003cstrong\u003eabalone inlays\u003c\/strong\u003e, symbolizing strength, wisdom, and prosperity. Flowing \u003cstrong\u003eresin accents\u003c\/strong\u003e seamlessly enhance the forearm and butt sleeve, creating remarkable depth, contrast, and visual elegance. The \u003cstrong\u003ewrapless canadian maple handle\u003c\/strong\u003e preserves the uninterrupted beauty of the natural grain while providing a smooth, comfortable feel and exceptional control.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEngineered for discerning players and collectors, the Imperial Dragon pairs breathtaking artistry with tournament-ready performance. The \u003cstrong\u003epremium Kielwood shaft\u003c\/strong\u003e delivers outstanding stability and consistency, while the \u003cstrong\u003eBlack Diamond tip\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003eUS phenolic ferrule\u003c\/strong\u003e, and precision \u003cstrong\u003eRadial pin\u003c\/strong\u003e provide a solid, responsive hit with every shot. Completing this premium package is a \u003cstrong\u003ematching custom extension\u003c\/strong\u003e, seamlessly integrated to complement the cue's striking design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 19 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCue Length:\u003c\/strong\u003e 58\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eShaft:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Kielwood Shaft\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTip:\u003c\/strong\u003e Black Diamond Tip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFerrule:\u003c\/strong\u003e US Phenolic Ferrule\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eForearm:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Ashwood with Handcrafted Dragon Design, Resin \u0026amp; Abalone Inlays\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHandle:\u003c\/strong\u003e Wrapless Premium Ashwood\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Sleeve:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Ashwood with Resin \u0026amp; Handcrafted Abalone Inlays\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAccessories:\u003c\/strong\u003e Matching Custom Extension Included\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLegendary artistry. Exceptional craftsmanship. Built to perform and destined to be admired for generations.\u003c\/strong\u003e 🎱\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43453562781744,"sku":null,"price":45000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/94aa14a0-076f-48b8-a897-8b8360415369.png?v=1785662302","url":"https:\/\/cuesmastershop.com\/products\/imperial-dragon-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-cues-master","provider":"Cues Master Shop","version":"1.0","type":"link"}